            <title>[IGNITE-20947] Fix misprint in add-opens of sun.util.calendar for java 15+</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-20947</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now: &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;--add-opens=java.base/sun.util.calendar=ALL-UNNAME
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Should be:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;--add-opens=java.base/sun.util.calendar=ALL-UNNAMED
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
